; DrainShelf (#1202): the drain is floored at y=400 except a 30 px slot in the middle (x=-15..15), so a fighter dropped or shoved in is caught on screen and climbs out. The slot is too narrow for a fighter (48 px) to fall through: ring-outs are gone from the Bowl on purpose, because any slot a fighter can fall through was fallen through by bots within ~10 s (first stage death 8-10 s). This is the one stage where damage decides the round, as its description above says; `every_stage_can_ring_out` exempts it (`RINGOUT_EXEMPT_1202`).
